  "title": "Eco Wave Power Welcomes New Israeli Government Blue-Tech Energy Initiative to Advance Marine Renewable Energy Innovation",
  "summary": "TEL AVIV, Israel, July 21, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Eco Wave Power Global AB (NASDAQ: WAVE) (“Eco Wave Power” or the “Company”), a leading developer of onshore wave energy technology, today welcomed the joint initiative announced by Israel’s Ministry of Energy and Infrastructure and the Israel Innovation Authority to invest NIS 6 million (approximately $2 million USD) in advancing next-generation Blue-Tech energy technologies.…",
